        <activityName xml:lang="en">Potassium carbonate from manganese dioxide oxidation, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Potassium carbonate from manganese dioxide oxidation, at plant
The multioutput-process "Manganese dioxide oxidation" delivers the co-products potassium permanganate and hydrogen. The allocation is based on stoechiometric calculation.;
UUID: 70bc61ed-a618-3ba3-a279-574d4751dcc9
Manganese dioxide oxidation process including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Oxidation of manganese dioxide
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Amount of byproduct hyrdogen has been omitted from the dataset. Emissions are estimated. Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_70bc61ed-a618-3ba3-a279-574d4751dcc9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
